  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing COVID-19 Vaccination Services at the Points of Entry in the Democratic Republic of the Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the national vaccination programme to allow the implementation of COVID-19 vaccination activities at 20 designated points of entry (POE) in eight provinces, targeting international travellers, border users, and frontline workers, including health professionals working at the POE, for an estimated number of 100,000 people entering country through the targeted POEs. In particular, the project will target frequent cross border travellers between DRC and its neighbouring countries.</narrative>
  </description>
